## Benefits of Using Environment Variables

✅ **Security:** No sensitive data in source code
✅ **Flexibility:** Easy to change configuration per environment
✅ **Deployment:** Same code runs on dev/staging/production
✅ **CI/CD:** Automated deployments with different configs
✅ **Containerization:** Docker/Kubernetes compatible
✅ **Maintainability:** Single source of truth for configuration
✅ **Version Control:** Keep `.env` files out of git
✅ **Scalability:** Easy to manage in microservices architecture

