**Step 4:** Use for conditional logic
```javascript
if (NODE_ENV === 'production') {
  // Production-specific configuration
  app.set('trust proxy', 1);
  app.use(helmet.hsts());
} else {
  // Development-specific configuration
  app.use(require('morgan')('dev'));
}
```

