## 🟡 MEDIUM: No Input Validation

### Severity: MEDIUM
### CVSS Score: 7.5 (High)
### CWE: CWE-20 - Improper Input Validation

### The Problem

```javascript
// Current app.js - no validation
app.get('/users', (req, res) => {
  res.json([...]);
});

// Attacker can send:
// GET /users?limit=9999999999
// GET /users?offset=-1
// GET /users?callback=<script>
// GET /users?format=../../../../etc/passwd
```

### Attack Scenarios

#### 1. Parameter Injection
```bash
# Server crashes with huge limit
curl "https://yourapp.com/users?limit=999999999999999999999"

# Database crashes trying to allocate memory
```

#### 2. Malicious Query
```bash
# Negative offset causes issues
curl "https://yourapp.com/users?offset=-1"

# Special characters in parameters
