By using centralized configuration management:

✅ **Easy to Deploy:** Different environments with different configs  
✅ **Secure:** Secrets from environment, not in code  
✅ **Flexible:** Change settings without code changes  
✅ **Maintainable:** All configuration in one place  
✅ **Validated:** Configuration validated on startup  
✅ **Documented:** All options explained in .env.example  

