- ✅ Port configurable via PORT env var
- ✅ Host configurable via HOST env var
- ✅ User data configurable via USERS_DATA or defaults
- ✅ NODE_ENV explicitly handled
- ✅ Added error handling middleware
- ✅ Enhanced health check with environment info
- ✅ Graceful shutdown support
- ✅ Full environment configuration support

---

