| Feature | Original | Improved |
|---------|----------|----------|
| Port Configuration | ❌ Hardcoded | ✅ Env var (PORT) |
| Host Binding | ❌ Implicit localhost | ✅ Configurable (HOST) |
| User Data | ❌ Hardcoded | ✅ Env var or defaults |
| NODE_ENV | ❌ Not checked | ✅ Explicitly set |
| Error Handling | ❌ None | ✅ Middleware added |
| Health Info | ⚠️ Minimal | ✅ Rich metadata |
| Shutdown | ❌ No | ✅ Graceful |
| Scalability | ❌ Single port only | ✅ Multiple instances |
| Container Ready | ❌ No | ✅ Yes |
| Production Ready | ❌ No | ✅ More ready |

