ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,https://example.com
CORS_ENABLED=true
HTTPS_ENABLED=false
SESSION_SECRET=your-secret-key-here
JWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret-here
```

### **Logging Configuration**
